You peer out on of the windows as you crawl forward, looking down into the arcade and spot the tables in the distance where the numerous adults and parents sit and chat. You even spot your little brother <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> sitting and drinking a soda. Seems the boy was able to escape the tunnels. <span style="color:pink">You turn back just in time to collide face-first into <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Chase</span>’s rearend!</span> You back up and apologizing, blushing slightly as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Chase</span> giggles and teasing you, chanting <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Butt face, butt face!”</span> as he wiggles his rear at you. <span style="color:pink">Sounds like the lad needs to be taught a lesson.</span> <br>
<br>
