        <span style="color:pink">With a smirk, you reach out and slap his rear end with enough force to shock him, though not actually hurt him. He yelps as you spank him, giggling as he tries to quickly crawl away.</span> Sadly for him, the boy is pretty slow, so you get a bit more swats in before he finds a side tunnel that leads down a slide and jumps down it face first. You chuckle as he disappears into the ball pit and swims away. <br>
